WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.435
-For your little ones,
Macy's has

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.203
the festive fashions that'll
have them saying...

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:05.971
-It's too hot!

