-[ Crying ]

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.910
♪♪

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:14.681
[ Applause ]
♪♪

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:17.450
-Are you ready to find out?
-I'm nervous.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.720
-Don't be.
Everything's gonna be fine.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:23.989
-Deciding to have a baby
wasn't a simple decision.

00:00:23.989 --> 00:00:26.392
-So we didn't want a pregnancy
test that just gave us a simple

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:27.761
yes or a no.

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:29.462
-We wanted more information.

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:32.065
-And when it comes to giving
information, there's only

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:34.466
one name we trust to give it
to us constantly.

00:00:34.466 --> 00:00:38.204
-That's why we use the new CNN
Take-Home Pregnancy Test.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.840
Its relentless, breaking alerts
let us know

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:44.477
that it's working hard to find
out if we're having a baby.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:45.644
[ Test chimes ]
-Breaking --

00:00:45.644 --> 00:00:47.513
search for
pregnancy underway.

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:51.151
-As CNN slowly analyzes
my urine, it updates me

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.485
on its breaking-news screen.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:53.819
[ Test chimes ]
-Breaking --

00:00:53.819 --> 00:00:55.754
search for
pregnancy continues.

00:00:55.754 --> 00:00:57.823
-'Cause CNN believes we
deserve all the information

00:00:57.823 --> 00:00:59.391
they can find.
[ Test chimes ]

00:00:59.391 --> 00:01:01.628
Breaking -- CNN more
confident than ever

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:04.097
that it will
soon know if you're pregnant.

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:05.464
-Okay.

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:08.267
-Even if that information is
no information.

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:09.601
[ Test chimes ]

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:12.438
-Breaking -- search for
pregnancy enters third week.

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:15.174
-Why is this taking so long?
It's 2014.

00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:16.542
-Honey, it's not the stick's
fault.

00:01:16.542 --> 00:01:17.877
It's telling you
everything it knows.

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:20.179
-I know.
I'm not mad at the stick.

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:23.416
It's just, this was fun at
first, but now it's like,

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.685
"Wait
and tell me when you know."

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:27.987
-With breaking alerts
every 10 minutes.

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.221
[ Test chimes ]
-Breaking --

00:01:29.221 --> 00:01:31.857
six million U.S. women
get pregnant each year.

00:01:31.857 --> 00:01:32.858
-So?

00:01:32.858 --> 00:01:34.126
-Daytime...
[ Test chimes ]

00:01:34.126 --> 00:01:36.796
-Breaking...
-...and nighttime.

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:39.298
-Oh, my God.
-We're having a baby?

00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:43.036
-Nope. Oscar Pistorius
took his legs off in court.

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:45.839
-He was found guilty?
-No.

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:48.040
It was just about the legs.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.576
And when CNN finally does
make a discovery about

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:52.045
our pregnancy...
-Pregnancy found!

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:54.113
-Pregnancy found!
-Yes!

00:01:54.113 --> 00:01:55.882
-Oh, my God!
...I know it will be accurate...

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:57.283
[ Test chimes ]
Oh.

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.251
- Breaking -- cannot confirm
pregnancy.

00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:00.719
-...15% of the time.

00:02:00.719 --> 00:02:03.256
-Great.
-Great. Cool. Awesome.

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:04.723
Totally great!
-Fine.

00:02:04.723 --> 00:02:07.060
The CNN Take-Home
Pregnancy Test.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.062
-For when you want to know
that they don't know.

00:02:10.062 --> 00:02:12.164
Honey, I guess I<i> was</i> pregnant.

00:02:12.164 --> 00:02:14.900
-Wow.
[ Giggling ]

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.135
-Thanks, CNN.

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:17.870
[ Test chimes ]
-Breaking...

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:20.439
-Oh, and Kesha just took the
dollar sign out of her name.

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:21.974
-Hmm.
-Hmm.

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:23.142
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.142 --> 00:02:24.978
-Meet little Sara.
-Isn't she beautiful?

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:27.714
-Oh, my gosh.
-Look at those pudgy cheeks.

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:29.382
-She's a good little eater.

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:31.951
-I love her roly-poly arms.

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:34.920
-Would you look at her little
tubby tummy?

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.156
-Okay, let's put the baby away.

00:02:37.156 --> 00:02:39.958
