00:02:55.975 --> 00:03:00.980
-In no time, your baby will go
from flab to fab.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.382
Now that's a tight baby.

00:03:03.382 --> 00:03:05.151
-What do you think now?

00:03:05.151 --> 00:03:07.553
-Oh, my God.
I hate your baby.

00:03:07.553 --> 00:03:08.787
