Tabby Spanx -- Spanx for cats.

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.776
-The first months of a child's
life are a special time.

00:03:30.776 --> 00:03:33.913
As your baby acquires the skills
of social interaction,

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:37.383
