decreased confidence,

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:01.574
and even lowered social status.

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:03.743
Is that what you want
for your child?

00:04:03.743 --> 00:04:06.279
That's why our scientists
at Nelson Pediatrics

00:04:06.279 --> 00:04:09.315
