00:04:32.471 --> 00:04:34.473
Hey, look at Mr. Popular.

00:04:34.473 --> 00:04:36.275
Now he's king of the play date.

00:04:36.275 --> 00:04:38.311
He looks good, and he knows it.

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:40.513
Isn't that what every
parent wants?

00:04:40.513 --> 00:04:41.948
I should know.

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:44.884
I'm not only the President
of Nelson's Baby Toupees.

00:04:44.884 --> 00:04:47.520
I'm also the father
of a client.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.521
-Nelson's Baby Toupees.

00:04:49.521 --> 00:04:52.358
From the good people who
